B6 auto_attach: factory change detected by identity, cache stamped on the Map
   same [strict-eq-object] === on two non-primitive operands; use equals(a, b)
   stamp [member-write] write to a Map<string, number>, which is not Mut
B9 #166 apply: CodeMirror state looked up by a stale key, then dereferenced
   text [possibly-undefined] property doc of a value that may be undefined
B10 paste/up/down: a handler closes over the selection from when the button was built
   paste [action-capture] edited depends on state (the value of the state cell edited), so an action using it would act on the value from the cell's last run; read the state cell inside the action with read(...), or pass the value to the action when it is called
B10' the fix the language asks for: read at the call
   accepted: edited ok, pasted ok, paste ok
